@startuml seq-live-updates
!include style.iuml
title Figure 10 (new): Live updates when another member changes the group (NFR 3)
actor "Member B\n(this phone)" as B
participant ":GroupDetailActivity" as UI
participant ":GroupViewModel" as VM
participant ":TransactionRepository" as TR
participant ":Subscription" as SUB
participant "db : FirebaseFirestore" as DB
actor "Member A\n(another phone)" as A

B -> UI : open a group
UI -> VM : startLiveUpdates(groupId)
VM -> TR : observeTransactions(groupId, onChange)
TR -> DB : addSnapshotListener(changesOnly(onChange))
TR --> VM : Subscription
note right of VM : also GroupRepository.observeGroup(groupId, onChange)\nfor renames, member changes and deletion
DB --> SUB : first snapshot (already shown) → ignored
...
A -> DB : adds / edits / deletes an expense or settlement
DB --> SUB : new snapshot (no pending local writes)
SUB -> VM : onChange.run()
VM --> UI : remoteChange (Event)
UI -> UI : refreshAll(): each tab reloads and recomputes\nhistory, balances and summary (C3 unchanged)
UI --> B : updated screen without pulling to refresh
...
B -> UI : leave the screen
UI -> VM : onCleared()
VM -> SUB : remove()
@enduml
